":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Domain","start":149,"end":231,"description":"RRM 1"},{"type":"Domain","start":259,"end":337,"description":"RRM 2"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":276,"end":276,"description":"5-hydroxylysine; by JMJD6"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":294,"end":294,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Domain","start":385,"end":466,"description":"RRM 3"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts with U2AF1L4 (By similarity). Heterodimer with U2AF1 (PubMed:11551507). Binds unphosphorylated SF1 (PubMed:10449420, PubMed:12718882). Interacts with SCAF11 and SNW1 (PubMed:21460037, PubMed:9447963). Interacts with ZRSR2/U2AF1-RS2. Interacts with RBM17 (PubMed:17589525). Interacts with PRPF19; the interaction is direct. Interacts with POLR2A (via the C-terminal domain); recruits PRPF19 and the Prp19 complex to the pre-mRNA (PubMed:21536736). Interacts with KHDC4 (Isoform 2) (PubMed:19641227). Interacts with ZRSR2 (PubMed:9237760). Interacts with the SF3B complex composed of SF3B1, SF3B2, SF3B3, SF3B4, SF3B5, SF3B6 and PHF5A (PubMed:27720643). Interacts (via N-terminus) with CPSF7 (via C-terminus); this interaction stimulates pre-mRNA 3'-end processing by promoting the recruitment of the CFIm complex to cleavage and polyadenylation signals (PubMed:17024186). Interacts with ARGLU1; interaction may be involved in ARGLU1-mediated modulation of alternative splicing (PubMed:30698747)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"P26368-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":471,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000450554.6"],"refseq":["NM_001012478.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001012496.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,344],[345,349,127]],"edits":[{"start":345,"end":348,"original":"VSPP","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":4,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-P26368-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P26368-2-F1-model_v6.c